%N A367732 Decimal expansion of Sum_{k>=1} (-1)^(k+1) / (k^2 * k!).
%F A367732 From _Peter Bala_, Sep 30 2026: (Start)
%F A367732 Equals Sum_{k >= 1} (-1)^(k+1)*H_2(k)*(k+2)/(k+1)!, where H_2(n) = Sum_{k = 1..n} 1/k^2 = A007406(n)/A007407(n).
%F A367732 Equals (1/2)*Integral_{x = 0..1} exp(-x)*log(x)^2 dx.
%F A367732 Equals the triple integral Integral_{z = 0..1} Integral_{y = 0..1} Integral_{x = 0..1} exp(-x*y*z) dx dy dz. (End)
